# BC AI Backend — Cursor Rules

## Project
- Go 1.26 module `smlcloudplatform` — unified backend (mainapi + goapi)
- Framework: Echo v4
- Databases: MongoDB, PostgreSQL, ClickHouse, Kafka, Redis

## Structure
- `cmd/goapi/` — goapi entry point (port 8888, BI/analytics)
- `cmd/app/` — mainapi entry point (port 8080, cloud platform)
- `internal/goapi/` — goapi packages (handlers, mydb, mypg, myclickhouse, myglobal, etc.)
- `pkg/` — shared utilities (mainapi)
- goapi imports: `smlcloudplatform/internal/goapi/...`

## CRITICAL: Config Rules
- ALL config from `bootstrap.json` ONLY — loaded via `internal/goapi/setupconfig/loader.go`
- NEVER use `.env` files, `godotenv`, `env_file` in docker-compose
- bootstrap.json path: `/app/bootstrap.json` (Docker), `C:/Windows/Temp/bcdev/config/bootstrap.json` (Windows)
- Docker mount: `bootstrap.json:/app/bootstrap.json:rw`

## Docker Stack (docker-compose.yml)
- goapi: port 8888, Dockerfile.goapi (no CGO)
- mainapi: port 9090→8080, Dockerfile (CGO + librdkafka)
- MongoDB: mongo:7 port 27017
- PostgreSQL: postgres:16-alpine port 5432
- ClickHouse: clickhouse-server:latest port 8123/9000
- Redis: redis:7-alpine port 6379
- Kafka: cp-kafka:7.7.1 port 9092 (internal: kafka:29092)

## Build
- goapi: `go build ./cmd/goapi/` (no CGO)
- mainapi: `CGO_ENABLED=1 go build -tags musl main.go`
- Docker: `docker compose build goapi && docker compose up -d`

## Code Style
- Thai language OK in logs/comments
- Logger: `logger.Info()`, `logger.Error()`, `logger.Success()`
- Database via `mydb.DatabaseManager` with circuit breaker
- Echo responses: `c.JSON(status, data)`

## MCP Server
- SSE: `GET /mcp/sse` (Claude Desktop)
- Tools: `GET /mcp/tools`
- Health: `GET /mcp/health`
